---
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { bookingRules, site } from '../config/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = 'November 2, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description={`The terms for booking cleanings with ${site.name}.`}
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="Legal" title="Terms of service" lead={`Last updated ${updated}.`} />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow prose">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {site.disclaimer} Nothing on this site is an official statement of Gordon College policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Bookings</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>A booking reserves a cleaning window. Your cleaner arrives during that window.</li>
        <li>
          Someone who lives in the room must be there to let the cleaner in. We don’t accept keys or
          ID cards.
        </li>
        <li>
          If no one is there within 15 minutes of the window starting, the visit may count as a
          no-show.
        </li>
        <li>
          We may decline or cancel a booking, for example if a booking looks fraudulent or the job
          can’t be done safely. If we cancel, we’ll tell you as soon as possible.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Payment</h2>
      <p>
        Prices are listed on our <a href="/services">Services &amp; Rates</a> page or given in a
        custom quote. Payment is due in person, in full, when the cleaning is finished, with cash or
        Venmo ({site.contact.venmoHandle}). We never collect payment online.
      </p>

      <h2>Cancelling and rescheduling</h2>
      <p>
        Cancel or reschedule for free by contacting us at least{' '}
        {bookingRules.cancellationNoticeHours} hours before your window. Repeated late cancellations
        or no-shows may mean we can’t accept future bookings.
      </p>

      <h2>What we do and don’t promise</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We clean against the checklist published on our Services page.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>We can’t guarantee you’ll pass an inspection or avoid fines.</strong> Inspections
          cover more than cleanliness, and Gordon College Residence Life decides what passes.
        </li>
        <li>
          We don’t do repairs or remove college property, and we don’t clean shared floor bathrooms
          in traditional halls.
        </li>
        <li>Please put away valuables and anything fragile before your visit.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Problems</h2>
      <p>
        If something on the checklist was missed or something went wrong during a visit, contact us
        within 24 hours at <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> and
        we’ll work with you to make it right.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms. The version on this page when you book applies to that booking.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }
  .prose li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
